WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.733
Toad fought with the raccoon in the speeding car.

2
00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:23.600
The car went side to side on the road.

3
00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:27.275
"Give me the wheel!" cried the raccoon.

4
00:00:27.276 --> 00:00:32.358
"Get your hands off me!" yelled Toad.

5
00:00:32.359 --> 00:00:37.364
Toad grabbed the wheel with all his might.

6
00:00:37.365 --> 00:00:40.142
The car turned suddenly.

7
00:00:40.143 --> 00:00:44.145
"Ahhh!" cried Toad.

8
00:00:44.146 --> 00:00:49.091
The car crashed through a row of bushes.

9
00:00:49.092 --> 00:00:53.357
"Oh no!" cried the raccoon.

10
00:00:53.358 --> 00:00:59.233
Then the car crashed into a muddy pond.

11
00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:02.357
Toad bounced out of the car.

12
00:01:02.358 --> 00:01:05.687
He landed in soft grass.

13
00:01:05.688 --> 00:01:11.474
The driver and his friends landed in the mud.

14
00:01:11.475 --> 00:01:15.753
"Look at you!" laughed Toad.

15
00:01:15.754 --> 00:01:19.801
"Call the police!" they yelled.

16
00:01:19.802 --> 00:01:24.557
"I have to escape!" cried Toad.

17
00:01:24.558 --> 00:01:27.805
Toad hopped up and ran.

18
00:01:27.806 --> 00:01:30.275
He climbed over fences.

19
00:01:30.276 --> 00:01:32.954
He jumped across ditches.

20
00:01:32.955 --> 00:01:36.205
He crawled through bushes.

21
00:01:36.206 --> 00:01:41.801
Toad ran and ran until he was far away.

22
00:01:41.802 --> 00:01:46.908
"Toad wins again!" he laughed.

23
00:01:46.909 --> 00:01:50.352
He walked happily through a field.

24
00:01:50.353 --> 00:01:54.063
He sang a little song.

25
00:01:54.064 --> 00:01:57.904
"Who asked them to give him a ride?

26
00:01:57.905 --> 00:02:00.946
Clever Toad!

27
00:02:00.947 --> 00:02:04.349
Who tricked them to let him drive?

28
00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.470
Clever Toad!

29
00:02:07.471 --> 00:02:10.077
Who made them muddy and mad?

30
00:02:10.078 --> 00:02:12.486
Who made them sorry and sad?

31
00:02:12.487 --> 00:02:17.551
Who escaped and feels so glad?

32
00:02:17.552 --> 00:02:26.800
Clever Toad! Clever Toad!"
